# You can get this by...
# 1. Opening https://meu.pluggy.ai/
# 2. Connecting the accounts you'd like to access
# 3. Opening your browser's devtools
# 4. Clicking on the account
# 5. Looking at the 'Network' tab, where you should see a request like: https://my-api.pluggy.ai/transactions?accountId=abcXXXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXXXXXXX123
