# !!IMPORTANT!! you must link your MyPluggy account (meu.pluggy.ai, where you manage bank accounts) to the developer portal account (dashboard.pluggy.ai) for transactions
# to start appearing! You can do this by following the steps here: https://github.com/pluggyai/meu-pluggy?tab=readme-ov-file#connecting-your-bank-account-to-meupluggy
#
# NOTE: You might have multiple accounts at a given bank; you'll need to create separate ACCOUNT_X_XXXXX vars in this file for each!
